---
/**
 * "Aurora & Grain" decorative background layer (design §2).
 *
 * Pure CSS — no JS, no GSAP: three drifting radial-gradient orbs, a faint
 * dot-grid and an SVG film-grain overlay. All animation is `transform`-only
 * (composited, no layout, no CLS) and stops under `prefers-reduced-motion`.
 *
 * Decorative by contract: `pointer-events-none` + `aria-hidden="true"` so it
 * never intercepts clicks and is never announced to assistive tech. Rendered
 * once as the first child of `<body>` in `Layout.astro`; `<main>`/`<footer>`
 * stack above it (`relative z-10`) so no text sits under the effect.
 */
---

<div class="ambient-bg" aria-hidden="true" transition:persist="ambient">
  <div class="ambient-orb ambient-orb--blue"></div>
  <div class="ambient-orb ambient-orb--sky"></div>
  <div class="ambient-orb ambient-orb--gold"></div>
  <div class="ambient-grid"></div>
  <div class="ambient-noise"></div>
</div>
